  "nameSource": {
    "kind": "invented",
    "note": "Gamertags are built from word lists written for this page: everyday words that pair well with a space, radio-style callsigns, silly British words and the xX…Xx wrappers of the Xbox 360 years. Every one is 12 characters or fewer, using letters, numbers and spaces and starting with a letter. Brands, game characters and famous players were checked for and left out. This page is not made by or connected with Microsoft or Xbox."
